# IM Folder is a temp folder of Siemens
# IM Folder can be deleted
# Tia portal will recreate the folders and files on the next compile
**/IM/

# This file holds the information of the last user that opened the project
# <User></User>
# <Computer></Computer>
# <Time></Time>
*.info

# this file is giving it a hard time
# in my opinion only PEData.plf and PEData.id are needed
# this file will only be used as long as the program is open
# once you close the program this file will be deleted and writen to the other files
**/System/~PEData.*

# ignore the microsoft temporary (lock) file that is created when the file is opened
~$*

#ignore siements temporary archive file
**/AdditionalFiles/PLCM/plcmArchive.pma*

#ignore Zip files which come up from the user
*.zip
